<title>UK: CPR sets 1.0 bln Ffr TEC-10 linked domestic bond.</title>
<headline>CPR sets 1.0 bln Ffr TEC-10 linked domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following TEC-10 linked issue was announced by joint lead managers Banque Nationale de Paris, Paribas and Compagnie Parisien de Reescompte.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMPAGNIE PARISIEN DE REESCOMPTE</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FFR   BASE	 TEC-10    MATURITY    31.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -1.05 PCT PAY DATE    31.DEC.96</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  101.30    REOFFER    100.0     FULL FEES   1.70</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	+36 BP OVER OAT TEC 10</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
